<Item XName="RxConfigure" UserName="RxConfigure" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>antDist_meterRx = 3.0*10^8/10e9/2; % Use 10GHz for antenna element distance&#x000D;&#x000A;Finc_GHz = tune(10);&#x000D;&#x000A;PortIdx = tune(1);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;using(&apos;Split1to16Data8GHzto12GHz.s17p&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;SParam = S(:,:,PortIdx);&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
